WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.160
YOUTUBE REWIND!

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.340
!DNIWER EBUTUOY

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.260
The new YouTube Rewind is up!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.640
*slow claps*

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.660
And I thought I would react to it for a good ol'-

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.540
good ol' time

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.840
I've been a part of YouTube Rewind since

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:13.740
uhhh

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.840
2013

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.540
It's always been very cool to be a part of, I remember when they did the first one.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.980
Everyone that wasn't in it was like, "Holy, holy heck! ...

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:23.980
(Christian channel)

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.480
... I would love to part of that, that looks cool!"

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:32.660
And I remember in the comments in the 2012 one, I wasn't in it

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:37.500
and people were so pissed cause I think I just became the biggest channel or something like that

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.720
and they was like, "Where. Is. PewDiePie?????"

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:43.300
But I was invited for 2013, it was a very fun and easy shoot.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.200
They came to Brighton to shoot it with me.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.580
I can't believe I've been in Brighton for so long..

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.820
I was like a little easter egg in the end.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:57.700
Because of all the comments in the last video they were like, "Alright, we'll put him in the end so people—" The tension! Will he be in this one?!

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.020
Who knows????

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.080
There it is!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.380
Man... I look soo different.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:13.820
They just asked me to do a bunch of weird stuff with it. I'm like "I don't know.. I'll scream at it.."

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.580
But it was cool, it was a really fun shoot.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:26.100
I think rewind for me, has always been really good because— and (for) YouTubers in general, cause it's such a huge production

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.940
We're not really used to being in front of cameras with other people.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:36.460
For me, it was really good practice. because whenever you're here it's my space, I know .. my stuff but like

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:42.640
if you have a whole crew in front of you with their cameras, I don't know who they are? I don't even think they know who I am?

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.360
And then you're expected to do your thing, like that's super weird so...

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:49.820
I though rewind was really good to like get more practice.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:50.900
2014

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:55.980
I loved this one. I actually got a bigger part in this one which I thought was

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.100
pretty deserved, you know?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.560
Uhhh... and it was also in Brighton.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.220
This one took forever to film.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.780
My god— we went soo overtime. Literally everyone left.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.340
Still. I loved filming this one.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:19.960
First of all, it turned out fucking great.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:24.980
I actually had to jump through like an actual piece of wood or something like that

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:29.880
You have to be brave. I did it so many times, I must've done it at least 10 times.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:33.080
Uhh, and it started really hurting after awhile.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:36.620
I had a stunt- professional stuntman helping me out and it was so fun.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.600
It was suuuper fun. I loved it.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.480
2015 everybody!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.260
This one was weird. I'm not gonna lie. I was like...

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.640
They were like, "Okay so you're gonna be with Zoella" I'm like...

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:49.460
Okay..

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.500
Why not Marzia?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.440
You know she's lives in Brighton too, right, like...???

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.580
Like why isn't Zoella with Alfie, he's a bigger YouTuber, too??

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.540
(should we do it?)

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.160
( lets do it! )

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.360
Super cool. Super cool.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.580
2016!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:23.720
I don't think I- I was barely in this one. I was busy shooting uhhh... Scare PewDiePie.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.680
I think I was going through my mental breakdown period.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.440
Yeah it was YouTube- It was Scare PewDiePie season 2.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.400
Yeahyeah- that was it.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.140
And uh, I happened to be in their studio so they were like, "Dude we gotta have you in."

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.560
Really uh... really important role in that one. (sarcasm)

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:50.900
I always really enjoyed YouTube rewind. They do take a lot of time and I think you have to give up a day

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:56.820
and for someone that's on a daily YouTube grind that's a big deal. But it's worth it because it's such a cool production to be part of

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:02.880
even if it's just for 2 or 3 seconds. It became pretty clear to me at least that rewind isn't really

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:11.600
like, in 2012 when I first saw it I was like, "Okay this is something cool that all the creators are part of to celebrate YouTube."

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:16.820
But.. I mean, it's an advertisement. It's an advertisement for YouTube and that's fine.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:22.740
I'm not saying that there's anything wrong with that but it's sorta like when you realize that, it doesn't really become the same thing

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:29.740
In my head at least, it used to be something that you wanted really to be acknowledged as a creator.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.880
For 2017 YouTube Rewind...

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.320
I AM NOT IN IT.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.320
Big surprise! I know!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:38.820
It wasn't because I said no, it was because I wasn't asked.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.600
Yeah.. no... it's- it's cool..

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.120
2017 has been quite the year.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:48.720
It's sad in a way that I'm not part of it but like, I understand why.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.700
Like I'm not salty at YouTube for not inviting me or something.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:57.760
But at the end of the day I care more about YouTube. I care more about what's good for YouTube; what's good for the platform.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:03.040
Than me being in it and I don't know... pissing people off? I don't know.

